Third-party components
----------------------

  linkr-bee/web/, linkr-bee/snapshot/web/, linkr-bee/patches/
      Derived from radxa/linkr-bee (https://github.com/radxa/linkr-bee),
      Apache-2.0. Baseline commit d9b2e00. See linkr-bee/LICENSE.

  linkr-bee/web/vendor/xterm, vendor/addon-fit
      @xterm/xterm and @xterm/addon-fit, MIT. Licenses alongside the files.

  linkr-bee/web/vendor/marked           MIT
  linkr-bee/web/vendor/dompurify        Apache-2.0 OR MPL-2.0
  linkr-bee/web/vendor/jszip            GPL-3.0 OR MIT (see LICENSE.markdown)
  linkr-bee/web/vendor/esptool-js       Apache-2.0
  linkr-bee/web/vendor/agent            Apache-2.0 (see LICENSES.txt)
  linkr-bee/web/vendor/macaron-cursors  CC-BY-4.0
  linkr-bee/web/fonts/                  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL.txt)

  Zephyr RTOS
      Upstream: https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr, tag v4.5.0,
      Apache-2.0.  The application is an out-of-tree Zephyr app and does NOT
      vendor Zephyr sources.  It needs the V851S BSP branch
      "v851s-e907-bsp" (based on v4.5.0, commit 6ebcb271c) from
      https://github.com/Novice-PG/zephyr (fork) or the corresponding pending
      upstream PR.  OpenAMP, libmetal and the NS16550 driver come from that
      Zephyr tree; their own licenses (BSD-3-Clause / Apache-2.0) apply.

  linkr-bee web front-end
      Baseline: https://github.com/radxa/linkr-bee, commit d9b2e00,
      Apache-2.0 (copy in linkr-bee/LICENSE).  The full patched tree is
      shipped under linkr-bee/web/ so the board needs no checkout; the
      patches in linkr-bee/patches/ reproduce it from that commit.

  The Allwinner Tina SDK, vendor libraries, vendor firmware blobs, full flash
  images and chip datasheets are not included (Allwinner EULA).

Not included
------------

  Allwinner Tina SDK sources, vendor libraries, vendor firmware blobs, full
  flash images and chip datasheets are not part of this repository. They are
  covered by the Allwinner EULA and are not redistributable. Obtain them from
  the vendor; this repository only carries the code and configuration written
  for this board.
